omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vyZTUj9VIkMQ7kNvwH0FhPX&_nc_oc=AdozdUTplxYVifskdhLmL5dftv5tpdq99FGrCODt9WsFVN_mm903lNxCGOJdby1NxYI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyCSaExRMQc7OaZTWPyzYdjjUjdyq3aDSYzZTqy5hZsqQ&oe=69CFA2F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o8v1DNI60OAQ7kNvwGkyGpW&_nc_oc=AdpY5x7y6al2JUDfrCfotbRV16BnqTfjCpaoI9Hi7vyEXp904gdw-UiniB4farHbyzw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwnjQnyGoDVpmnyDBj6-Cow_3yCVY0x06USj0g4CJrxBg&oe=69CFA456"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=svCj30hxt0MQ7kNvwGYINLX&_nc_oc=AdrmZd-N5KJ7GDNafQwzkofnKaSvUr3nJlfLb2HQWcD49WR3EfA6Bvq2cOGd9zJJDSE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afw5uWAnbUIC_39FBret28e8j3ftc5jlWKfK-K0h5ODBLg&oe=69CFB977"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://